            "review_title": "Review at Com & Pho 12",
            "review_text": "Dean S\n9 contributions\n0\nPrice to quality ratio cannot be beaten\nMay 2024 • Couples\nWe visited at midday. The pho place next door was rammed so we tried here on pure chance. No regrets. My favourite meal to date in Vietnam. \n\nHusband and wife served us. \n\nI had fried rice with chicken and veg. You must too!\n\nIf you want a humble and authentic quick meal, get in here. \n\nExtra star for husband humming to himself in background as we ate. Felt like the extended family.\nRead more\nWritten May 8, 2024",
