            "review_text": "scubacol11\nRotherham, United Kingdom2813 contributions\n2\nGood food,great value\nApr 2018 • Solo\nFirst visit here was a late night close to hostel need to eat quick meal,had the chicken pho that was excellent and a cold beer,called back later in the week just fancied something plain so had steamed pac choy and steamed rice,the pac choy was very tasty and cooked to perfection.Most of the staff don\"t speak very good English but not a problem as the menu is in English,but you are welcomed with a smile and good service,I think it\"s a much better option than the more noted restaurant next door and would certainly return when back in Hanoi and would recommend to everyone.Great food,great value.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten August 27, 2018",
